OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early brighter spells will
OL,6,Fsoon give way to thickening cloud,
OL,7,Fwhich will produce some drizzle at
OL,8,Ftimes, especially during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Gusty winds over the Peak
OL,10,FDistrict. Feeling chilly. Maximum
OL,11,FTemperature 7C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with patchy drizzle
OL,14,Fthis evening. Becoming dry with
OL,15,Fvariable amounts of cloud and
OL,16,Foccasional clear spells overnight.
OL,17,FWinds easing. Turning chilly, with
OL,18,Fpatchy frost in places. Minimum
OL,19,FTemperature 3C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
