OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FLargely dry with variable
OL,6,Famounts of cloud on Sunday, but also
OL,7,Fsome brighter spells, especially away
OL,8,Ffrom coastal districts. Winds will be
OL,9,Flighter compared to previous days.
OL,10,FFeeling chilly. Maximum Temperature 7C.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FLargely dry and cloudy, with some
OL,14,Fcoastal showers likely, especially
OL,15,Flater Monday into Tuesday. Little
OL,16,Fchange Wednesday, with often large
OL,17,Famounts of cloud and occasional
OL,18,Fbrighter spells. Feeling chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
